WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.380
Since you didn’t participate in a sport, what were sporting events like at LSU at that time?

2
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:08.460
Unbelievable.

3
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:15.620
You know, just as it is today, if you’ve never heard that roar in Tiger Stadium on a Saturday night, you know you’ve really missed it.

4
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.840
There was lots of excitement, lots of energy.

5
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:21.280
When you went to the football game, the stadium was just charged.

6
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.000
I mean, it was wired.

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.040
You almost felt like it was moving.

8
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:31.700
And there was like a whistle that just went round and round the stadium, more I guess, of like a roar.

9
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.620
Lots of excitement.
